---
title:    "An ER-based Framework for Declarative Web Programming"
citation: "(TPLP 2014)"
url:      "http://dx.doi.org/10.1017/S1471068412000385"
date:     2014-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes a framework to generate web applications from
an entity-relationship (ER) model of the underlying data.
The generated implementation contains operations to create
and manipulate entities of the data model, supports authentication,
authorization, session handling, and the composition of individual operations to user processes.
Furthermore, the implementation ensures the integrity of the database after update operations.